// 工作台「測試」頁（對應 C# UI/Work/TestsPage.cs）：需修復、需測試、測試總覽三種測試視圖。
// 契約：匯出 global TestsPageData（Rust 端用 window.global::<TestsPageData>() 讀寫）與 component TestsPage；
// 這兩個名稱與檔名不可改（workspace.slint 依此匯入）。
import { Theme, Motion, ScrollView, Segmented, ProgressBar, Tip } from "@hb/index.slint";
import { CheckRow, SelectField, StatusLine, GroupLabel } from "@hbc/index.slint";
import { W2, W2Button, W2Small, W2Input, W2Link, W2Project, W2ProjectSelect, W2Title } from "w2-common.slint";

/// 清單的一項。kind：0 段落標題（點了收合）、1 段落說明、2 分組標題（點了收合）、3 一列。
/// 一列的 mode：0 測試任務（〔加入測試結果〕）、1 需修復（期限、預估、主要按鈕）、2 需測試／總覽（主要按鈕、退回）；
/// meta-tone：0 淡色、1 警告、2 紅色；hot：第 3 輪起（底色深一點）。
export struct TestsItem {
    kind: int,
    text: string,
    toggle-key: string,
    key: string,
    title: string,
    tip: string,
    meta: string,
    meta-tone: int,
    hot: bool,
    mode: int,
    due: string,
    primary-text: string,
    primary-tip: string,
    busy: bool,
}

export struct TestsBatch {
    text: string,
    tip: string,
}

export struct TestsCard {
    label: string,
    value: string,
    sub: string,
    alert: bool,
}

/// 總覽子狀態的一項：index ≥ 0 時有批次按鈕（button），不然後面是「・」。
export struct TestsSub {
    text: string,
    button: string,
    tip: string,
    index: int,
}

export struct TestsStage {
    stage: string,
    subs: [TestsSub],
}

export struct TestsProgress {
    key: string,
    title: string,
    ratio: float,
    counts: string,
}

export global TestsPageData {
    in-out property <bool> loading;
    in-out property <[string]> views;
    in-out property <int> view-index;
    in-out property <[W2Project]> projects;
    in-out property <int> project-index;
    in-out property <[string]> groupings;
    in-out property <int> group-index: 1;
    in-out property <[string]> periods;
    in-out property <int> period-index;
    in-out property <[string]> severities;
    in-out property <int> severity-index;
    in-out property <string> filter;
    in-out property <bool> mine: true;
    in-out property <bool> hot;
    /// 測試總覽：只顯示期間，不顯示分組、嚴重度、篩選、只看我的、第 3 輪起
    in-out property <bool> overview-mode;
    in-out property <string> summary;
    in-out property <string> status-text;
    in-out property <int> status-tone;
    in-out property <[TestsBatch]> batches;
    in-out property <[TestsItem]> items;
    in-out property <[TestsCard]> cards;
    in-out property <string> severity-text;
    in-out property <[TestsStage]> stages;
    in-out property <string> tests-title;
    in-out property <[TestsProgress]> progress;
    in-out property <string> stale-title;
    in-out property <[TestsItem]> stale-rows;
    callback view-selected(index: int);
    /// 專案、期間、只看我的換了：重讀
    callback reload-needed();
    /// 分組、嚴重度、篩選、第 3 輪起換了：重畫
    callback render-needed();
    callback refresh();
    callback toggle(key: string);
    callback copy-key(key: string);
    callback open-task(key: string);
    /// list：0 清單、1 總覽的逾時清單；id：add、reopen、primary
    callback row-action(list: int, index: int, id: string);
    callback due-edited(list: int, index: int, text: string);
    callback estimate-accepted(list: int, index: int, text: string) -> bool;
    callback batch(index: int);
    callback sub-batch(index: int);
}

component TestRow inherits Rectangle {
    in property <TestsItem> data;
    in property <int> list;
    in property <int> index;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: root.data.hot ? Theme.warn-soft.with-alpha(0.6) : ta.has-hover ? Theme.hover.with-alpha(0.5) : transparent;
    height: 38px;
    ta := TouchArea { }
    HorizontalLayout {
        padding-left: 8px;
        padding-right: 8px;
        spacing: 0px;
        // 點編號複製、點名稱看詳細
        Rectangle {
            horizontal-stretch: 1;
            min-width: 60px;
            HorizontalLayout {
                spacing: 6px;
                W2Link {
                    text: root.data.key;
                    color: Theme.accent;
                    tip: "點一下複製編號";
                    clicked => { TestsPageData.copy-key(root.data.key); }
                }
                W2Link {
                    text: root.data.title;
                    tip: root.data.tip;
                    font-weight: 400;
                    clicked => { TestsPageData.open-task(root.data.key); }
                }
                Text {
                    text: root.data.meta;
                    font-size: 12px;
                    color: root.data.meta-tone == 2 ? Theme.error : root.data.meta-tone == 1 ? Theme.warn : Theme.muted;
                    vertical-alignment: center;
                    overflow: elide;
                    horizontal-stretch: 1;
                    min-width: 20px;
                }
            }
        }
        if root.data.mode == 0: W2Small {
            y: (parent.height - self.height) / 2;
            text: "＋ 加入測試結果";
            tip: "R：記一個問題";
            clicked => { TestsPageData.row-action(root.list, root.index, "add"); }
        }
        if root.data.mode == 1: HorizontalLayout {
            spacing: 6px;
            padding-left: 6px;
            due := W2Input {
                y: (parent.height - self.height) / 2;
                width: 96px;
                height: 28px;
                horizontal-stretch: 0;
                font-size: 12px;
                placeholder: "期限";
                tip: "期限（預計結束），例 11/5、明天；清空就是沒有期限";
                text: root.data.due;
                accepted => { self.unfocus(); }
                focus-lost(t) => {
                    TestsPageData.due-edited(root.list, root.index, t);
                    // Rust 會把這一列的 due 換成存好的值（看不懂時換回原本的）
                    self.text = root.data.due;
                }
            }
            W2Input {
                y: (parent.height - self.height) / 2;
                width: 64px;
                height: 28px;
                horizontal-stretch: 0;
                font-size: 12px;
                placeholder: "預估 h";
                tip: "預估工時（小時），打完按 Enter";
                accepted(t) => {
                    if TestsPageData.estimate-accepted(root.list, root.index, t) {
                        self.unfocus();
                    }
                }
            }
        }
        if root.data.mode != 0: Rectangle { width: 6px; }
        if root.data.mode != 0: W2Small {
            y: (parent.height - self.height) / 2;
            text: root.data.busy ? "處理中…" : root.data.primary-text;
            tip: root.data.primary-tip;
            primary: true;
            enabled: !root.data.busy;
            clicked => { TestsPageData.row-action(root.list, root.index, "primary"); }
        }
        if root.data.mode == 2: Rectangle { width: 6px; }
        if root.data.mode == 2: W2Small {
            y: (parent.height - self.height) / 2;
            text: "↩ 退回";
            tip: "還有問題，退回給工程師（輪數 +1）";
            clicked => { TestsPageData.row-action(root.list, root.index, "reopen"); }
        }
    }
}

/// 段落、分組標題：點一下收合／展開。
component ToggleHeader inherits Rectangle {
    in property <string> text;
    in property <bool> section;
    callback clicked;
    height: root.section ? 36px : 30px;
    Text {
        x: 0;
        width: parent.width;
        y: parent.height - self.height - 2px;
        text: root.text;
        color: root.section ? Theme.ink : Theme.muted;
        font-size: root.section ? Theme.fs-md : 12px;
        font-weight: root.section ? 700 : 600;
    }
    TouchArea {
        mouse-cursor: pointer;
        clicked => { root.clicked(); }
        Tooltip {
            Tip {
                text: "點一下收合／展開";
            }
        }
    }
}

component OverviewCard inherits Rectangle {
    in property <TestsCard> data;
    background: Theme.fill;
    border-radius: 16px;
    min-width: 120px;
    preferred-width: 120px;
    horizontal-stretch: 1;
    VerticalLayout {
        padding-left: 14px;
        padding-right: 14px;
        padding-top: 8px;
        padding-bottom: 8px;
        Text {
            text: root.data.label;
            color: Theme.muted;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        Text {
            text: root.data.value;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-family: Theme.font-num;
            color: root.data.alert ? Theme.error : Theme.ink;
        }
        if root.data.sub != "": Text {
            text: root.data.sub;
            color: Theme.muted;
            font-size: 11px;
        }
    }
}

export component TestsPage inherits Rectangle {
    VerticalLayout {
        padding-left: W2.pad-x;
        padding-right: W2.pad-x;
        padding-top: W2.pad-top;
        padding-bottom: W2.pad-bottom;
        spacing: 8px;

        HorizontalLayout {
            spacing: 14px;
            padding-bottom: 2px;
            W2Title {
                text: "測試";
            }
            Segmented {
                y: (parent.height - self.height) / 2;
                items: TestsPageData.views;
                current <=> TestsPageData.view-index;
                selected(i) => { TestsPageData.view-selected(i); }
            }
            Rectangle { horizontal-stretch: 1; }
            W2Button {
                y: (parent.height - self.height) / 2;
                text: "⟳ 重新整理";
                clicked => { TestsPageData.refresh(); }
            }
        }

        HorizontalLayout {
            spacing: 8px;
            W2ProjectSelect {
                width: 200px;
                items: TestsPageData.projects;
                current <=> TestsPageData.project-index;
                selected => { TestsPageData.reload-needed(); }
            }
            if TestsPageData.overview-mode: SelectField {
                width: 110px;
                height: 38px;
                items: TestsPageData.periods;
                current <=> TestsPageData.period-index;
                selected => { TestsPageData.reload-needed(); }
            }
            if !TestsPageData.overview-mode: W2Input {
                width: 180px;
                height: 38px;
                horizontal-stretch: 0;
                placeholder: "🔍 名稱或編號";
                text <=> TestsPageData.filter;
                edited => { TestsPageData.render-needed(); }
            }
            if !TestsPageData.overview-mode: SelectField {
                width: 120px;
                height: 38px;
                items: TestsPageData.severities;
                current <=> TestsPageData.severity-index;
                selected => { TestsPageData.render-needed(); }
            }
            if !TestsPageData.overview-mode: SelectField {
                width: 130px;
                height: 38px;
                items: TestsPageData.groupings;
                current <=> TestsPageData.group-index;
                selected => { TestsPageData.render-needed(); }
            }
            if !TestsPageData.overview-mode: CheckRow {
                text: "只看跟我有關的";
                checked <=> TestsPageData.mine;
                toggled => { TestsPageData.reload-needed(); }
            }
            if !TestsPageData.overview-mode: CheckRow {
                text: "第 3 輪起";
                tip: "只看退回 2 次以上的";
                checked <=> TestsPageData.hot;
                toggled => { TestsPageData.render-needed(); }
            }
            Rectangle { horizontal-stretch: 1; }
        }

        Text {
            text: TestsPageData.summary;
            color: Theme.muted;
        }
        StatusLine {
            text: TestsPageData.status-text;
            tone: TestsPageData.status-tone;
        }
        if TestsPageData.batches.length > 0 && !TestsPageData.overview-mode: HorizontalLayout {
            spacing: 6px;
            for b[i] in TestsPageData.batches: W2Small {
                text: b.text;
                tip: b.tip;
                clicked => { TestsPageData.batch(i); }
            }
            Rectangle { horizontal-stretch: 1; }
        }

        sv := ScrollView {
            vertical-stretch: 1;
            content-height: body.preferred-height;
            body := VerticalLayout {
                width: sv.visible-width - 14px;
                spacing: 2px;
                for item[i] in TestsPageData.items: VerticalLayout {
                    if item.kind == 0 || item.kind == 2: ToggleHeader {
                        text: item.text;
                        section: item.kind == 0;
                        clicked => { TestsPageData.toggle(item.toggle-key); }
                    }
                    if item.kind == 1: Text {
                        text: item.text;
                        color: Theme.faint;
                        font-size: 12px;
                        height: 20px;
                        vertical-alignment: center;
                    }
                    if item.kind == 3: TestRow {
                        data: item;
                        list: 0;
                        index: i;
                    }
                }

                // ───────────── 測試總覽 ─────────────
                if TestsPageData.overview-mode: VerticalLayout {
                    spacing: 8px;
                    HorizontalLayout {
                        spacing: 8px;
                        padding-bottom: 2px;
                        for c in TestsPageData.cards: OverviewCard {
                            data: c;
                        }
                    }
                    if TestsPageData.severity-text != "": Text {
                        text: TestsPageData.severity-text;
                        color: Theme.muted;
                    }
                    if TestsPageData.stages.length > 0: GroupLabel {
                        text: "子狀態";
                    }
                    for st in TestsPageData.stages: HorizontalLayout {
                        spacing: 0px;
                        Text {
                            width: 64px;
                            text: st.stage;
                            color: Theme.muted;
                            vertical-alignment: center;
                        }
                        for s in st.subs: HorizontalLayout {
                            spacing: 8px;
                            padding-right: s.index >= 0 ? 6px : 0px;
                            Text {
                                text: s.text;
                                color: Theme.ink;
                                vertical-alignment: center;
                            }
                            if s.index >= 0: W2Small {
                                text: s.button;
                                tip: s.tip;
                                clicked => { TestsPageData.sub-batch(s.index); }
                            }
                            if s.index < 0: Text {
                                text: "・";
                                color: Theme.muted;
                                vertical-alignment: center;
                            }
                        }
                        Rectangle { horizontal-stretch: 1; }
                    }
                    GroupLabel {
                        text: TestsPageData.tests-title;
                    }
                    if TestsPageData.progress.length == 0: Text {
                        text: "這段期間沒有測試任務";
                        color: Theme.muted;
                    }
                    for t in TestsPageData.progress: HorizontalLayout {
                        height: 26px;
                        Rectangle {
                            horizontal-stretch: 1;
                            HorizontalLayout {
                                W2Link {
                                    text: "🧪 " + t.key;
                                    clicked => { TestsPageData.open-task(t.key); }
                                }
                                Text {
                                    text: t.title;
                                    color: Theme.ink;
                                    overflow: elide;
                                    vertical-alignment: center;
                                    horizontal-stretch: 1;
                                }
                            }
                        }
                        Rectangle {
                            width: 160px;
                            ProgressBar {
                                x: 8px;
                                width: parent.width - 16px;
                                height: 6px;
                                value: t.ratio;
                                fill: Theme.run;
                            }
                        }
                        Text {
                            width: 230px;
                            text: t.counts;
                            font-size: 12px;
                            color: Theme.muted;
                            vertical-alignment: center;
                            overflow: elide;
                        }
                    }
                    if TestsPageData.stale-title != "": GroupLabel {
                        text: TestsPageData.stale-title;
                    }
                    for r[i] in TestsPageData.stale-rows: TestRow {
                        data: r;
                        list: 1;
                        index: i;
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
